sequenceDiagram
participant OPS as Phase 07 Operations
participant JC as Job Cost Engine
participant POST as Posting Engine
participant GL as General Ledger
participant TWIN as Financial Digital Twin
OPS->>JC: Approved labor/equipment/material transaction
JC->>JC: Validate project, cost code, period, dimensions
JC->>POST: Create balanced accounting event
POST->>GL: Post journal batch
GL-->>POST: Posting result
POST->>TWIN: Publish financial event
TWIN-->>OPS: Updated cost, margin, forecast and alerts
